        <p class="hero-intro">Welcome. You have chosen a team, a color, and an emotional commitment that may outlast several phone upgrades.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="#starter">Start here <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
