    <section class="readiness-band" aria-labelledby="readiness-title">
      <div class="readiness-label"><p class="eyebrow">A VERY SCIENTIFIC SCALE</p><h2 id="readiness-title">Fan readiness<br><em>meter</em></h2></div>
      <div class="meter-wrap">
        <div class="meter-head"><label for="readiness-slider">MOVE THE MARKER TO YOUR CURRENT STATUS</label><span class="meter-status"><i></i> YOUR CALL</span></div>
        <input class="meter-slider" id="readiness-slider" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="58" step="1" aria-label="Fan readiness. Zero means just learned the roster; one hundred means you have explained clock management to a stranger at the grocery store.">
        <div class="meter-labels"><span>I just learned the roster</span><span>I have explained clock management<br>to a stranger at the grocery store</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="meter-doodle" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 170 120" role="presentation"><path d="M22 85c29-37 59-51 104-54M26 91c31-20 62-22 105-17M102 23l28 7-14 23"/><path d="M41 79c8-13 17-18 28-21M55 91c7-9 15-13 24-15"/></svg>
        <span>PREPARED<br>ISH</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section starter-section" id="starter" aria-labelledby="starter-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>01</span><span>THE STARTER GUIDE</span><span class="kicker-line"></span></div>
      <div class="starter-grid">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="starter-title">Your first<br><em>game day.</em></h2>
          <p class="section-lede">Start with the essentials. The rest can be learned through observation, snacks, and increasingly specific opinions.</p>
          <div class="callout"><span class="callout-symbol" aria-hidden="true">!</span><p>Going to Lincoln Financial Field? Check the venue’s current rules before you go. <span>Being prepared is a winning tradition.</span></p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="starter-list">
          <article class="starter-item"><span class="item-number">01</span><div><h3>Wear green.</h3><p>Any shade will do. Confidence helps.</p></div><span class="item-icon" aria-hidden="true">●</span></article>
          <article class="starter-item"><span class="item-number">02</span><div><h3>Learn “Go Birds.”</h3><p>Greeting, farewell, affirmation. A flexible phrase.</p></div><span class="item-icon bird-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
          <article class="starter-item"><span class="item-number">03</span><div><h3>Check the weather.</h3><p>Philadelphia has seasons. Football has all of them.</p></div><span class="item-icon" aria-hidden="true">☼</span></article>
          <article class="starter-item"><span class="item-number">04</span><div><h3>Remember: “it’s early.”</h3><p>A sincere observation, a coping strategy, or both.</p></div><span class="item-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rituals-section" id="rituals" aria-labelledby="rituals-title">
      <div class="ritual-photo-wrap">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Skyline_Philadelphia_Pennsylvania.JPG?width=1000" alt="Philadelphia skyline viewed from the PSFS Building" loading="lazy">
        <p class="photo-credit"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skyline_Philadelphia_Pennsylvania.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Photo: Renato Prestinenzi / Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 3.0</a></p>
        <div class="photo-note">A CITY THAT<br>SHOWS UP.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ritual-copy">
        <div class="section-kicker section-kicker-light"><span>02</span><span>GAME-DAY RITUALS</span></div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="rituals-title">The sacred<br><em>pregame routine.</em></h2>
        <p class="ritual-intro">A five-step process, refined over years of completely reasonable behavior.</p>
        <ol class="ritual-list">
          <li><span>01</span><p>Put on the jersey.</p><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li>
          <li><span>02</span><p>Say, “I’m feeling good about this one,” with whatever evidence you have.</p><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li>
          <li><span>03</span><p>Gather your snacks and drinks (may need a lot).</p><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li>
          <li><span>04</span><p>Tell yourself not to yell at the TV.</p><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li>
          <li><span>05</span><p>Yell at the TV like the players and coaches can hear you.</p><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li>
        </ol>
        <span class="handwritten">tradition is tradition</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section glossary-section" id="glossary" aria-labelledby="glossary-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>03</span><span>THE EAGLES FAN GLOSSARY</span><span class="kicker-line"></span></div>
      <div class="glossary-heading"><h2 class="section-title" id="glossary-title">Learn the<br><em>local language.</em></h2><p>Four phrases to get you through a game, a goodbye, and at least one questionable second-half decision.</p></div>
      <div class="glossary-grid">
        <article class="glossary-card"><span class="glossary-count">01 / THE ALL-PURPOSE</span><h3>“Go Birds.”</h3><p>Greeting, farewell, affirmation, and occasionally a complete conversation.</p><span class="glossary-scribble" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
        <article class="glossary-card"><span class="glossary-count">02 / THE REASSURANCE</span><h3>“We still have time.”</h3><p>A mathematically flexible phrase.</p><span class="glossary-scribble" aria-hidden="true">◷</span></article>
        <article class="glossary-card"><span class="glossary-count">03 / THE OBSERVATION</span><h3>“That’s a penalty.”</h3><p>A neutral observation that may become louder if repeated.</p><span class="glossary-scribble" aria-hidden="true">!</span></article>
        <article class="glossary-card glossary-card-green"><span class="glossary-count">04 / THE STORAGE PLAN</span><h3>“Next week.”</h3><p>The place where all reasonable expectations are temporarily stored.</p><span class="glossary-scribble" aria-hidden="true">→</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="survival-section" id="survival" aria-labelledby="survival-title">
      <div class="survival-topline"><span>FIELD NOTES / 04</span><span>FOR USE AFTER THE FINAL WHISTLE</span></div>
      <div class="survival-content">
        <div class="survival-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE SURVIVAL GUIDE</p><h2 class="section-title" id="survival-title">We lost.<br><em>Now what?</em></h2><p>First: take a breath. This is a guide, not a diagnosis.</p></div>
        <ol class="survival-steps">
          <li><span>01</span><p>Step away from the group chat if needed.</p></li>
          <li><span>02</span><p>Drink and eat more.</p></li>
          <li><span>03</span><p>Remember that one game cannot define your character, your city, or your ability to continue your day.</p></li>
          <li><span>04</span><p>Re-enter the conversation when you’re ready to discuss the game in a calm and measured way—or not so calm.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="survival-footer"><span>YOU SHOWED UP.</span><span>THAT COUNTS FOR SOMETHING.</span><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section quiz-section" id="quiz" aria-labelledby="quiz-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>05</span><span>THE QUICK CHECK</span><span class="kicker-line"></span></div>
      <div class="quiz-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">THREE QUESTIONS. NO PRESSURE.</p><h2 class="section-title" id="quiz-title">How’s your<br><em>fan progress?</em></h2></div>
        <p>Answer from memory, then reveal each answer. Give yourself one point for each correct answer and check your score below.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-list">
        <article class="quiz-question">
          <span class="quiz-number">QUESTION 01</span><h3>What’s the first step in the sacred pregame routine?</h3>
          <details class="quiz-answer"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>Put on the jersey. The ritual starts with the uniform.</p></details>
        </article>
        <article class="quiz-question">
          <span class="quiz-number">QUESTION 02</span><h3>Before going to Lincoln Financial Field, what should you check?</h3>
          <details class="quiz-answer"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>Check the venue’s current rules before you go.</p></details>
        </article>
        <article class="quiz-question">
          <span class="quiz-number">QUESTION 03</span><h3>Which phrase is described as “mathematically flexible”?</h3>
          <details class="quiz-answer"><summary>Reveal answer</summary><p>“We still have time.” Its flexibility is part of its usefulness.</p></details>
        </article>
      </div>
      <details class="quiz-score">
        <summary>Check your progress <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary>
        <div class="score-guide"><p><strong>0–1 correct:</strong> Starter status. Keep the guide handy.</p><p><strong>2 correct:</strong> Watch-party ready. You know the routines and the lingo.</p><p><strong>3 correct:</strong> Prepared-ish. Go forth and say “Go Birds.”</p></div>
      </details>
    </section>

